# service_svc.tkr — the §7 DI accept channel: one native build, each case addressed by NAME through
# `scenario` (main.tks + src/scenario.tks, the own_native member convention). The runtime-key cases
# (`svc_runtime_key_resolves*`, `has_svc_runtime_*`) are the Path-2 anti-regression: the inline
# service locator that used to SIGSEGV now BUILDS and RUNS, dispatching a provider chosen at run time.

Feature: service_svc — §7 dependency injection: service/svc, IService synthesis, const + runtime keys

  Scenario: svc_singleton_resolves — svc<Clock>().now() resolves a keyless singleton by type
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_singleton_resolves: ok"

  Scenario: svc_transient_fresh — svc<Rng>() yields a fresh transient instance
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_transient_fresh: ok"

  Scenario: svc_scoped_in_block — svc<Buf>() resolves inside a block
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_scoped_in_block: ok"

  Scenario: svc_keyed_const_disambiguates — svc<G>("EnHi") + svc<G>("FrHi") resolve by constant key
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_keyed_const_disambiguates: ok"

  Scenario: svc_runtime_key_resolves — svc<G>(key) with a runtime "EnHi" key builds and runs (Path 2)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_runtime_key_resolves: ok"

  Scenario: svc_runtime_key_resolves_fr — the runtime locator dispatches "FrHi" at run time
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_runtime_key_resolves_fr: ok"

  Scenario: has_svc_runtime_true_then_svc — has_svc<G>(key) is true for a registered runtime key
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario has_svc_runtime_true_then_svc: ok"

  Scenario: has_svc_runtime_false_branch — has_svc<G>(key) is false for an unregistered runtime key
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario has_svc_runtime_false_branch: ok"

  Scenario: svc_factory_return_ok — a freshly-constructed factory value escapes freely (provenance)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario svc_factory_return_ok: ok"
